{"parentUuid":"49e8270d-506c-4d40-9e33-a52b257460fd","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"aa7992fdbe17e1229","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019SNrfn6srmdrhcACMEDvqs","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Arknights Endfield industrial planner base building grid size facility types\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Arknights Endfield Blueprints & Codes - Best Optimized AIC Layouts\",\"url\":\"https://mobalytics.gg/arknights-endfield/bases/blueprints\"},{\"title\":\"Factory (AIC) Community Blueprints - Arknights Endfield | EndfieldTools.DEV - EndfieldTools.DEV\",\"url\":\"https://endfieldtools.dev/community-factories/\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights: Endfield - Base Building & Automation Mechanics - Mobalytics\",\"url\":\"https://mobalytics.gg/arknights-endfield/bases\"},{\"title\":\"Factory Planner Grid (AIC Builder) - Arknights: Endfield\",\"url\":\"https://endfieldtools.dev/factory-planner/planner/\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights: Endfield Factory Calculator & Production Planner | Endfield DB\",\"url\":\"https://endfielddb.com/calculator/\"},{\"title\":\"Early Game Factory Layout and Best Items Guide (Valley IV) | Arknights: Endfield｜Game8\",\"url\":\"https://game8.co/games/Arknights-Endfield/archives/575846\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights: Endfield AIC Factory System Guide\",\"url\":\"https://www.oslink.io/blog/guide/arknights-endfield-factory-building-guide.html\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights Endfield Base Building Guide | Arknights: Endfield\",\"url\":\"https://endfield.gg/arknights-endfield-base-building-guide/\"},{\"title\":\"How to Build Your First Base in Arknights: Endfield - Icy Veins\",\"url\":\"https://www.icy-veins.com/arknights-endfield/news/how-to-build-your-first-base-in-arknights-endfield/\"},{\"title\":\"Endfield Calculator – Factory & Resource Planner Tool\",\"url\":\"https://www.endfieldcalculator.com/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about Arknights Endfield's industrial planner and base building:\n\n## Factory Planner Tools\n\nThere is an interactive Arknights: Endfield AIC base builder with drag-and-drop functionality that allows you to design factory layouts, connect conveyors, manage power grids, and optimize production flows.\n\n## Facility Types\n\nThe Arknights: Endfield AIC system includes multiple facility types that work together to support efficient base building and factory construction, with core facility categories essential for managing production flow, power distribution, and resource movement as your base expands.\n\nSome specific facility types mentioned include:\n\n- Forges, which are facilities that can produce Xiranite\n- Thermal Banks, which add power to your grid and can be fed fuel like Originium\n- Smelters, Chemical Plants, and Assemblers with different power consumption characteristics\n- Conveyor Belts, which connect outputs to inputs to form production chains\n\n## Grid Information\n\nWhile the search results discuss factory planning extensively, they don't specify exact grid sizes for the industrial planner. The results focus more on the gameplay mechanics like power distribution, production chains, and facility management rather than technical specifications about grid dimensions.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"309d1e46-ded5-4b14-a5fa-eff507a054d0","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:09:11.453Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"49e8270d-506c-4d40-9e33-a52b257460fd","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
