内容。如果您需要更具体的网格70-80范围的设施配置方案，建议查看游戏社区（如B站、TapTap等平台）上的具体蓝图分享和攻略视频。\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"0a5deddd-eb1e-4514-9ed3-770475a01e15","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:09:12.797Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"548e92f8-7210-42de-bcb1-5bd67c3207bb","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
