Your First Base in Arknights: Endfield - Icy Veins\",\"url\":\"https://www.icy-veins.com/arknights-endfield/news/how-to-build-your-first-base-in-arknights-endfield/\"}]\n\nI've successfully performed a web search for information about Arknights Endfield factory layout optimization, power poles, storage boxes, and manufacturing. Here's what I found:\n\n## Key Factory Layout Optimization Tips\n\nEfficient base construction and smart layout planning are critical when building production chains to maximize output. Several important strategies include:\n\n**Space Efficiency:**\nRotate your structures to utilize the space efficiently - for example, you can place the Protocol Stash between two Refining Units and send the Packaging Unit's output to it backward.\n\n**Power Distribution:**\nEverything in the AIC needs power, which is distributed using Relay Towers that will extend electricity across the map with limited range dependent on terrain, and Electric Pylons that distribute power wirelessly to nearby facilities.\n\n**Storage and Logistics:**\nDuring mid-game, you gain access to the Protocol Stash and Depot Bus, which allow you to create production lines without relying on input and output ports of your PAC, and you should take advantage of these features to optimize your production lines.\n\n**Planning Strategy:**\nOpen the Database tab to review the full production chain of any material before building, as understanding inputs and outputs in advance helps prevent bottlenecks and wasted space.\n\nBlueprints let you save entire factory layouts including machines, conveyor belts, and power setups, allowing you to import a fully functional factory instantly.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"573ff628-c3b9-477c-9b0c-83e00c55da6d","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:09:13.098Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"de037bb9-0822-409c-bde6-37495948763d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claud