rknights Endfield (明日方舟：终末地). The project is open-source and available on GitHub at https://github.com/endfield-calc/factoriolab, with a feedback group at QQ: 1071155059.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"e9adf9da-9875-4e69-bd86-e5c0afff98b2","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:09:13.430Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"32fef63c-01b7-4f8f-9730-e055aabe2548","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
