{"parentUuid":"53ed7b51-d55a-4401-bd87-4036da6f79a9","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"aa7992fdbe17e1229","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014zQntohcvgDwwRoFG98nDx","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Arknights Endfield AIC grid size 70x70 80x80 base expansion blueprint\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Arknights Endfield Blueprints & Codes - Best Optimized AIC Layouts\",\"url\":\"https://mobalytics.gg/arknights-endfield/bases/blueprints\"},{\"title\":\"Factory (AIC) Community Blueprints - Arknights Endfield | EndfieldTools.DEV - EndfieldTools.DEV\",\"url\":\"https://endfieldtools.dev/community-factories/\"},{\"title\":\"How To Expand Core AIC Area Size In Arknights Endfield\",\"url\":\"https://gamerant.com/arknights-endfield-how-expand-core-aic-area-size-upgrade-factory-base/\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights: Endfield AIC Blueprints - Endfield Guide\",\"url\":\"https://mobalytics.gg/arknights-endfield/profile/mattjestic-multigaming/guides/arknights-endfield-blueprints-codes\"},{\"title\":\"EnKAD - Arknights: Endfield Factory Planner\",\"url\":\"https://enkad.enka.network/\"},{\"title\":\"Best AIC Layouts in Arknights Endfield (+Blueprint Codes) | Arknights: Endfield\",\"url\":\"https://endfield.gg/best-aic-layouts-arknights-endfield/\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights: Endfield - Base Building & Automation Mechanics - Mobalytics\",\"url\":\"https://mobalytics.gg/arknights-endfield/bases\"},{\"title\":\"Curated AIC Blueprints - Arknights: Endfield Factory Planner\",\"url\":\"https://enka.network/endfield/aic/blueprints\"},{\"title\":\"Best 1.2 AIC Factory Blueprints for Arknights: Endfield - Icy Veins\",\"url\":\"https://www.icy-veins.com/arknights-endfield/news/best-1-2-aic-factory-blueprints-for-arknights-endfield/\"},{\"title\":\"How to Expand Core AIC Base Area Size in Arknights Endfield ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wEG_GYPw1m0\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about Arknights Endfield AIC (Factory) base expansion and blueprints, though the specific grid sizes of 70x70 and 80x80 were not mentioned in these results.\n\nThe search returned several useful resources for AIC base expansion and blueprints:\n\n**Key Information Found:**\n\nTo expand the Core AIC Area in Arknights: Endfield, you must first complete the AIC Steward quest, after which an AIC Steward will appear on the southeastern side of your Core AIC Area. You can speak to the AIC Steward to open the area upgrade window, where you have two options: to expand the area, or to construct a Depot Bus.\n\n**Blueprint Resources:**\n\nSeveral community-driven sites and guides are available for finding optimized AIC blueprints:\n- EndfieldTools.DEV allows you to browse and share community Factory (AIC) blueprint codes for Wuling AIC and Valley-IV AIC layouts\n- EnKAD is an Endfield AIC blueprint editor where you can plan out factories and calculate production capacity\n- Multiple guide sites like Mobalytics and Icy Veins have curated blueprint recommendations for different game phases\n\nHowever, the specific grid dimensions (70x70 and 80x80) weren't detailed in these search results. You may need to check the actual blueprint editor tools or game documentation for exact grid size specifications.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"4f7979a4-674b-446a-916b-07b7ea2d0245","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:09:28.401Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"53ed7b51-d55a-4401-bd87-4036da6f79a9","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"1c07281c-c72e-4e1c-aa39-899ebae5f925","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"aa7992fdbe17e1229","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BRwEVo2kCL9QS1vtAAjcZA","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"终末地 1.2 武陵 80x80 网格 扩容 基地大小\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"《明日方舟终末地》武陵初期基建过渡教程 武陵初期蓝图分享-游民星空 GamerSky.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamersky.com/handbook/202601/2081343.shtml\"},{\"title\":\"【终末地】援助活动基建+1.2武陵基建蓝图速通版！摆完挂机稳定产线，庄方宜装备搓起来，抄作业必看！集成援助活动攻略！_哔哩哔哩bilibili\",\"url\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1pkdzBpEKU/\"},{\"title\":\"明日方舟终末地武陵模块化工厂蓝图分享_明日方舟终末地武陵模块化工厂布局推荐_3DM网游-3DM网游\",\"url\":\"https://ol.3dmgame.com/gl/331488.html\"},{\"title\":\"[终末地] 基建美学 武陵1.2上半毕业基建蓝图 模块化_哔哩哔哩_bilibili\",\"url\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yHoxBpEGV/\"},{\"title\":\"【终末地】这张1.2毕业蓝图是我对 极致压缩 的最终诠释，占用主基地不到1/3，精华全浓缩在了心脏修缮站，1.2版本基地毕业蓝图【懒得基建】\",\"url\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1nhoNBdEAP/\"},{\"title\":\"《明日方舟终末地》各阶段毕业蓝图分享 全地图毕业蓝图合集_武陵-一键毕业蓝图-游民星空 GamerSky.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamersky.com/handbook/202601/2083745_7.shtml\"},{\"title\":\"明日方舟·终末地蓝图分享（持续更新中）\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamekee.com/zmd/691229.html\"},{\"title\":\"【终末地】基建毕业蓝图攻略！一个视频看懂四号谷地+武陵 ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1s76FBGEow/\"},{\"title\":\"《明日方舟终末地》剧情开荒与基建心得 实用蓝图分享-游民星空 GamerSky.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamersky.com/handbook/202601/2081116.shtml\"},{\"title\":\"【终末地】1.2武陵基建进阶攻略！模块化教学！息壤/赤铜/壤晶模块拆解，手把手教你改产线！_哔哩哔哩bilibili_攻略\",\"url\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1DfdWBxEkm/\"}]\n\n根据搜索结果，我为您找到了关于《明日方舟：终末地》1.2版本武陵基建的相关信息：\n\n## 武陵基地扩容信息\n\n武陵基建默认只有200的容量，需要通过调度卷优先解锁场地扩容。\n\n## 网格和基地大小\n\n搜索结果中显示了许多关于1.2版本武陵基建的蓝图和优化方案。有一张蓝图强调占用主基地不到1/3，表明玩家可以通过合理的基建规划在有限的基地空间内优化产线布局。\n\n## 基建优化方案\n\n对于1.2版本，多个内容创作者分享了模块化的基建蓝图方案，包括：\n- 模块化产线设计，功能独立即插即用\n- 在点出洪炉扩容科技前，只能建造一座天有洪炉，点出科技后最多能够建造两座\n\n这些资源大多来自于Bilibili、游民星空等游戏社区，提供了从开荒到毕业的完整蓝图方案。\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"dedd7951-89ea-423b-b67e-1b62b5c0586d","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:09:29.388Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1c07281c-c72e-4e1c-aa39-899ebae5f925","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
