{"parentUuid":"eb05a514-42b1-4f3d-854a-69c462049754","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"aa7992fdbe17e1229","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015CB5o6PDAEFy6KUHuFEjQm","type":"tool_result","content":"# Arknights: Endfield Base Building - Facility Information\n\nBased on the provided guide, I can share the following information about AIC (Automated Industry Complex) facilities:\n\n## Available Facilities Mentioned\n\nThe guide references several facility types:\n- **Mining Units** - for extracting minerals\n- **Refining Units** - for processing raw materials\n- **Moulding Units** - for material refinement\n- **Fitting Units** - for component assembly\n- **Shredding Units** - for material breakdown\n- **Filling Units** - for product assembly\n- **Planting Units** - for plant cultivation\n- **Seed Picking Units** - for plant harvesting\n- **Packaging Units** - for final product creation\n- **Thermal Banks** - for power generation\n- **Electric Pylons** - for power distribution\n- **Protocol Stashes/Depot Loaders/Depot Unloaders** - for storage management\n- **Conveyor Belts** - for item transport\n\n## Important Limitations\n\nUnfortunately, the guide **does not provide**:\n- Specific grid dimensions (70x70, 80x80, etc.)\n- Exact facility footprints in grid squares\n- Power Pole range specifications\n- Storage Box capacity numbers\n- Conveyor Belt movement rules or specifications\n\nThe guide focuses on automation strategy and production optimization rather than technical specifications. For detailed facility dimensions and mechanical data, you'd need to consult in-game resources or dedicated database wikis."}]},"uuid":"d5c6f2a3-2a49-4300-acf4-8495a2cc277f","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:09:42.080Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"eb05a514-42b1-4f3d-854a-69c462049754","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2