{"parentUuid":"d02df7b5-97d5-4291-b308-c2b25845ddfa","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"263c4537-7eaf-4141-8243-2bd92971b2f2","agentId":"aa7992fdbe17e1229","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LGGfZaQ4ZYTJMM6tXjjqbJ","type":"tool_result","content":"# Core AIC Area Size in Arknights: Endfield\n\nBased on the provided article, **specific grid dimensions (such as 70x70 or 80x80) are not mentioned**. \n\nThe guide only states that \"The space for the Core AIC Area started rather limited, but can later be expanded to fit the Endmins' needs.\" It describes two expansion upgrades available:\n\n- **Area Expansion I** (20k Valley Stock Bills)\n- **Area Expansion II** (160k Valley Stock Bills)\n\nHowever, the article does not provide the exact maximum size or grid measurements after these expansions. To find that information, you would need to consult other sources or check the game directly."}]},"uuid":"17b0cb50-6f71-443b-9bff-7cc25bd80156","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:09:44.984Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d02df7b5-97d5-4291-b308-c2b25845ddfa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
