{"parentUuid":"6283d061-ffee-42e4-8f33-ff6277ddae89","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0f373ebb-a92e-4bba-8942-d03ed7b7aa78","agentId":"aa7992fdbe17e1229","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KKpEq4e624xMNK4cGcWRes","type":"tool_result","content":"# EnKAD: Arknights Endfield Factory Planner\n\nBased on the webpage content provided, here's what I can share:\n\n**Overview:**\nEnKAD is described as an \"Endfield AIC blueprint editor\" that enables users to \"Plan out your factories and calculate production capacity - right in the browser.\"\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Create factory plans from scratch or use existing blueprints\n- Browser-based planning tool\n- Community-driven with featured blueprints from players like Algoinde and Hikarin\n\n**Current Status:**\nThe latest version is 1.2, updated April 17, 2026.\n\n**Support & Community:**\nThe tool connects users to a Discord server for technical support and game strategy discussions.\n\n---\n\n**Note:** The webpage excerpt doesn't include the detailed facility specifications you're asking about (grid dimensions, port positioning rules, power pole coverage, Core AIC maximum size, or storage mechanics). That technical documentation may be available in the full tool interface or linked resources like the AIC tutorial."}]},"uuid":"ee971059-5581-42a0-b48b-dd9e6756a1e7","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:10:59.825Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6283d061-ffee-42e4-8f33-ff6277ddae89","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"22ea2f55-8ca9-4f25-99ce-48a8674b747a","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0f373ebb-a92e-4bba-8942-d03ed7b7aa78","agentId":"aa7992fdbe17e1229","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EakJw4toucFx1DgEna3DJD","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"endfield\" power pole coverage radius range tile cells wireless storage box\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Arknights: Endfield Base Building Guide\",\"url\":\"https://www.mumuplayer.com/blog/arknights-endfield-base-building-guide.html\"},{\"title\":\"Relay Tower - Arknights: Endfield Database | Gamer Guides®\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamerguides.com/arknights-endfield/database/facilities/combat-and-support/relay-tower\"},{\"title\":\"Zipline & Relay Tower Guide | Arknights: Endfield Wiki\",\"url\":\"https://arknightsendfield.wiki/guides/zipline-relay-tower-guide/\"},{\"title\":\"Relay Tower - Endfield Talos Wiki\",\"url\":\"https://endfield.wiki.gg/wiki/Relay_Tower\"},{\"title\":\"How To Solve the Sealed Crate Puzzle at Hub Base Power ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Pk_P7UHCBEg\"},{\"title\":\"Protocol Stash - Endfield Talos Wiki\",\"url\":\"https://endfield.wiki.gg/wiki/Protocol_Stash\"},{\"title\":\"AIC Factory Guide: Master Base Building in Arknights Endfield | GAMES.GG\",\"url\":\"https://games.gg/arknights-endfield/guides/arknights-endfield-aic-factory-guide/\"},{\"title\":\"Xiranite Pylon - Endfield Talos Wiki\",\"url\":\"https://endfield.wiki.gg/wiki/Xiranite_Pylon\"},{\"title\":\"Xiranite Relay - Endfield Talos Wiki\",\"url\":\"https://endfield.wiki.gg/wiki/Xiranite_Relay\"},{\"title\":\"Electric Pylon | Arknights Endfield Wiki - FextraLife\",\"url\":\"https://arknightsendfield.wiki.fextralife.com/Electric_Pylon\"}]\n\nBased on the search results for Arknights: Endfield, here's what I found regarding power poles and related coverage:\n\n## Relay Tower Coverage\n\nThe Relay Tower can transmit power to other facilities within an 80-meter radius. Relay Towers extend energy across the map, with each tower reaching up to 80 meters from a powered source.\n\n## Electric Pylon Coverage\n\nElectric Pylons wirelessly power all facilities within range with an estimated radius of approximately 30-50 meters. When outside the Core AIC Area, Xiranite Pylons auto-connect to other power facilities within a 30-meter radius.\n\n## Wireless Storage (Protocol Stash)\n\nRegarding wireless storage, the search results mention a Protocol Stash storage facility with several item storage slots that, once connected to the power grid and given enough power, can teleport items to the Depot.\n\n## Additional Power Infrastructure\n\nElectric Pylons distribute wireless power to all facilities within their radius. These are essential components of the power grid system that extends energy distribution across your base in Endfield.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"9deb2765-385a-4781-bf2b-9a454d4c0dda","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:11:00.984Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"22ea2f55-8ca9-4f25-99ce-48a8674b747a","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"c7e5a0b7-3885-4e25-8a5e-a8802e3a0616","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0f373ebb-a92e-4bba-8942-d03ed7b7aa78","agentId":"aa7992fdbe17e1229","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XSz29cMyag1g6LyWbTVT86","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"终末地 蓝图 模块化 power pole 储物箱 规则 心脏修缮\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"[终末地] 基建美学 武陵1.2上半毕业基建蓝图 模块化_哔哩哔哩_bilibili\",\"url\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yHoxBpEGV/\"},{\"title\":\"明日方舟·终末地蓝图分享（持续更新中）\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamekee.com/zmd/691229.html\"},{\"title\":\"《明日方舟终末地》基建蓝图机制讲解 怎么建造生产线-游民星空 GamerSky.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamersky.com/handbook/202512/2060593.shtml\"},{\"title\":\"【终末地】基建蓝图一键攻略！胶囊+装备原件+电池蓝图分享！幸运萝卜位置大全 《明日方舟：终末地》|魔法Zc目录_哔哩哔哩bilibili\",\"url\":\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1WVzWBuEoF/\"},{\"title\":\"《明日方舟终末地》稳定1760电力蓝图分享-游民星空 GamerSky.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamersky.com/handbook/202601/2080720.shtml\"},{\"title\":\"《明日方舟终末地》全物品产线蓝图推荐 开荒至毕业蓝图码合集_根据开荒时期分类-游民星空 GamerSky.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamersky.com/handbook/202601/2081087.shtml\"},{\"title\":\"蓝图分享！谷地毕业全区域蓝图布局分享 - 明日方舟：终末地攻略 - TapTap 明日方舟：终末地论坛\",\"url\":\"https://www.taptap.cn/moment/764951787147889213\"},{\"title\":\"《明日方舟终末地》各等级电池蓝图推荐 电池发电效率分析-游民星空 GamerSky.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamersky.com/handbook/202601/2081972.shtml\"},{\"title\":\"明日方舟终末地满效率高容电池发电站蓝图分享_明日方舟终末地满效率高容电池发电站布局推荐_3DM网游-3DM网游\",\"url\":\"https://ol.3dmgame.com/gl/331169.html\"},{\"title\":\"《明日方舟终末地》基建蓝图码合集 各产线模块蓝图分享_自循环种植模块-游民星空 GamerSky.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamersky.com/handbook/202601/2080838.shtml\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, your query relates to 《终末地》(Arknights: Endfield) base construction blueprints, featuring modular designs focused on extreme compression with key infrastructure like the Heart Repair Station.\n\nThe search results show content primarily from Bilibili videos and gaming websites discussing:\n\n1. **Modular Blueprint Design**: Players have created graduation-level base construction blueprints with modular and compressed designs, particularly emphasizing the Heart Repair Station.\n\n2. **Blueprint Codes and Sharing**: The game has a built-in blueprint sharing system on community forums where players can copy blueprint codes directly and share their base designs.\n\n3. **Production Line Optimization**: Blueprints utilize modular design principles with individual production lines for different materials, allowing players to choose efficiency based on their needs.\n\nThe search results contain multiple video guides and blueprint sharing resources from content creators discussing base construction strategies, power generation setup, and production line optimization for the game. If you need more specific information about particular blueprints or mechanics, feel free to ask!\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"8d43477f-6c7f-4596-a430-3308b411ffb1","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:11:02.257Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c7e5a0b7-3885-4e25-8a5e-a8802e3a0616","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"8d43477f-6c7f-4596-a430-3308b411ffb1","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"aa7992fdbe17e1229","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01U2ZqxNrn6GDe8ZDLehCLUa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GwM3h4e9qKZ4yUG68HKbe2","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python -c \"\nimport json\np=r'D:/claude pj/zmd/data/preprocessed/candidate_placements.json'\nwith open(p,encoding='utf-8') as f:\n    data=json.load(f)\nfp=data['facility_pools']\n# Power pole detail\npp=fp['power_pole'][0]\nimport json\nprint('--POWER POLE sample--')\nprint(json.dumps(pp,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)[:2000])\nprint('coverage cell count:', len(pp.get('power_coverage_cells',[])))\n# inspect a 6x4 fully\nm64=fp['manufacturing_6x4'][0]\nprint('--6x4 ports--')\nprint('inputs:', m64.get('input_port_cells'))\nprint('outputs:', m64.get('output_port_cells'))\n# inspect a 5x5\nm55=fp['manufacturing_5x5'][0]\nprint('--5x5 ports--')\nprint('inputs:', m55.get('input_port_cells'))\nprint('outputs:', m55.get('output_port_cells'))\n# inspect storage box\nsb=fp['protocol_storage_box'][0]\nprint('--storage box port_modes set--')\nmodes=set(p['pose_params']['port_mode'] for p in fp['protocol_storage_box'])\nprint(modes)\nprint('--3x3 port_modes--', set(p['pose_params']['port_mode'] for p in fp['manufacturing_3x3']))\nprint('--6x4 port_modes--', set(p['pose_params']['port_mode'] for p in fp['manufacturing_6x4']))\nprint('--5x5 port_modes--', set(p['pose_params']['port_mode'] for p in fp['manufacturing_5x5']))\nprint('--core port_modes--', set(p['pose_params']['port_mode'] for p in fp['protocol_core']))\nprint('--bsp port_modes--', set(p['pose_params']['port_mode'] for p in fp['boundary_storage_port']))\nprint('--power pole port_modes--', set(p['pose_params']['port_mode'] for p in fp['power_pole']))\n# 6x4 unique anchor count\nimport collections\nac=collections.Counter([(p['anchor']['x'],p['anchor']['y']) for p in fp['manufacturing_6x4']])\nprint('6x4 unique anc