{"parentUuid":"c2f683bb-dac3-4999-ad28-467facc9bc4f","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0f373ebb-a92e-4bba-8942-d03ed7b7aa78","agentId":"aa7992fdbe17e1229","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QY3gp1VfEaV7by1Mh2jAXw","type":"tool_result","content":"# Protocol Stash Information\n\nBased on the wiki page, here's what's documented:\n\n**Power Requirements:**\nThe facility \"can teleport items to the Depot\" and requires connection to a power grid, consuming **5 power units**.\n\n**Grid Size & Ports:**\nUnfortunately, the wiki page provided does not specify the grid dimensions (such as 3x3), nor does it detail input/output port rules or wireless transmission distance. The article focuses on general functionality rather than technical specifications.\n\n**Known Details:**\n- It's a \"storage facility with several item storage slots\"\n- Typically placed \"at the end of production lines\"\n- Requires the Basic AIC I - Field Stash plan to construct\n- Costs 20 Origocrust to build\n\nFor detailed dimensional and port information, you may need to consult in-game documentation or community resources like the wiki's Discord channel."}]},"uuid":"fb6b7c04-0a09-40a3-be63-ef348cfe87fe","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:11:25.482Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c2f683bb-dac3-4999-ad28-467facc9bc4f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
