{"parentUuid":"1f9419f5-682e-4515-83af-47b3d50ed74e","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0f373ebb-a92e-4bba-8942-d03ed7b7aa78","agentId":"aa7992fdbe17e1229","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QEGyLZzYjpxxMcQyvBrKrx","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"endfield\" protocol storage box wireless range tile depot bus production line\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Protocol Stash - Endfield Talos Wiki\",\"url\":\"https://endfield.wiki.gg/wiki/Protocol_Stash\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights: Endfield Depot Bus & Easy Stash Guide\",\"url\":\"https://www.ldshop.gg/blog/arknights-endfield-gp/depot-bus-easy-stash.html\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights: Endfield - Base Building & Automation Mechanics - Mobalytics\",\"url\":\"https://mobalytics.gg/arknights-endfield/bases\"},{\"title\":\"How Depot Nodes Work in Arknights: Endfield (Storage, Deliveries, and Factory Links)\",\"url\":\"https://allthings.how/how-depot-nodes-work-in-arknights-endfield-storage-deliveries-and-factory-links/\"},{\"title\":\"Depot Bus Section - Endfield Talos Wiki\",\"url\":\"https://endfield.wiki.gg/wiki/Depot_Bus_Section\"},{\"title\":\"Protocol Stash - Arknights: Endfield Database | Gamer Guides®\",\"url\":\"https://www.gamerguides.com/arknights-endfield/database/facilities/assembly/protocol-stash\"},{\"title\":\"Depot Bus System Uses Explained in Arknights Endfield\",\"url\":\"https://nerdschalk.com/depot-bus-system-uses-explained-in-arknights-endfield/\"},{\"title\":\"Upgrading your storage in Endfield is tied to your Depot Node, so make sure you know where they are\",\"url\":\"https://gamerant.com/arknights-endfield-all-depot-node-locations-how-upgrade-storage/\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights: Endfield Depot Node Guide: Locations & Upgrades — NeonLightsMedia\",\"url\":\"https://www.neonlightsmedia.com/blog/arknights-endfield-depot-node-locations-guide\"},{\"title\":\"Arknights: Endfield Protocol Stash — What It Does and Why It Beats Depot Loaders\",\"url\":\"https://allthings.how/arknights-endfield-protocol-stash-what-it-does-and-why-it-beats-depot-loaders/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's information about the Protocol Stash and related systems in Arknights: Endfield:\n\n## Protocol Stash\n\nThe Protocol Stash is a storage facility with several item storage slots that can teleport items to the Depot once connected to the power grid and given enough power. It took Endfield engineers nearly a decade to achieve tele-protocol of small items within limited range.\n\nThe Protocol Stash is a 2×2 factory building that wirelessly transfers items from your production lines into your base depot — no depot bus slot required. The stash is often placed at the end of production lines.\n\n## Depot Bus System\n\nThe Depot Bus is a shared transport layer that sits between your production lines and your Depot, letting you inject items into the Depot from anywhere and retrieve them later where they're needed. Depot Bus Section is an AIC facility that can be deployed in the Core AIC Area and must be connected to a Depot Bus Port or other active Depot Bus Sections.\n\n## Production Lines and Storage Integration\n\nProduction lines send crafted items into depot storage, and a limited number of outputs (PAC ports and the Depot Bus) pull items back out for further processing or trade goods. Protocol Stash structures can send outputs back to depot without using precious bus slots.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"bd666381-c066-4d8a-887a-86982d94fa8e","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:11:36.749Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1f9419f5-682e-4515-83af-47b3d50ed74e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"bd666381-c066-4d8a-887a-86982d94fa8e","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"aa7992fdbe17e1229","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01PxRLA1M2empsFGeCgkQsPt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"材料够了。整理输出。\n\n---\n\n# 终末地（Arknights: Endfield）游戏特性 → Placement 模型简化调研\n\n## 一、游戏机制核心要点（基于网络资料 + 本地 canonical_rules.json + candidate_placements.json 交叉核对）\n\n1. **基地核心区（Core AIC Area）网格**：游戏内通过两次扩容（Area Expansion I = 20k Stock Bills，II = 160k）才能解锁满尺寸。我们项目锁定的 70×70 是 Valley4 Protocol Core 满扩容后的尺寸；1.2 武陵开放了\"工业三期\"但**目前公开资料未确认网格扩到 80×80**，玩家攻略只说\"建设等级上限提升\"\"容量从默认 200 调度卷扩\"，没有提到网格本身放大。我们的 `globals.grid = 70x70` 与游戏当前现实一致。\n2. **设施类型**（与本地 7 类 facility_template 完全对得上）：\n   - manufacturing_3x3（crusher / refinery / molding / parts_maker）\n   - manufacturing_5x5（planter / seed_collector）\n   - manufacturing_6x4（grinder / packaging / filling）\n   - protocol_core 9×9（每基地恰好 1 个，6 输出 14 输入硬限）\n   - protocol_storage_box 3×3（\"Protocol Stash\"，无线传送到 Depot，5 电力，社区资料称 2×2 与我们 3×3 不一致——见后文）\n   - power_pole 2×2（覆盖半径 5 格 → 49 格方阵，本地数据已确认）\n   - boundary_storage_port 1×3（Item Control Port，**只能贴左/下边界**，方向朝内）\n3. **端口规则**：本地 candidate pool 端口模式仅 4 种 `{TB, BT, LR, RL}` + core 的 2 种 `{core_LR_out, core_TB_out}` + 边界端口 2 种 `{left_base, bottom_base}` + 电杆 omni。这意味着**所有制造设施和储物箱端口都在两条相对边缘**，玩家社区也确认\"端口在机器对侧\"是硬规则（GameWith / Mobalytics / EnKAD 都基于此）。\n4. **传送带规则**（路由）：本地 routing_rules 已编码 elevated / ground 双层；玩家社区共识就是\"短距走 ground，长距/穿越用 elevated 桥接\"。Wiki 仅说\"Belts are blood vessels of the AIC Factory\"，没量化。\n5. **配方与产量**：本地 17 个 recipe 全部覆盖 1.0 谷地核心（电池 packaging_battery、胶囊 filling_capsule 等），但 1.2 武陵新增的 8 类设备（**二型耐酸水泵 / 多口暗管入出口 / 提纯机 / 扩容反应池 / 高能射线塔 / \"酸洗\"MK-Ⅰ / 重锤迫击炮**）以及新液体\"沉积酸\"**目前不在 canonical_rules 里**——这是 future_scope，对当前 70×70 valley4 不影响。\n6. **Core 强约束**：1 Protocol Core，6 outputs / 14 inputs。本地已硬编码 `core_limits.max_outputs=6, max_inputs=14`，与游戏数值一致。\n7. **Storage Box 是无线节点**：`port_rule: omni_wireless` —— 社区资料确认 Protocol Stash \"无线发送到 Depot，不占 PAC 端口、不占 Depot Bus 槽位\"，这是**真正的无线**，不需要传送带连接。当前模型把它当成 3×3 + TB/BT/LR/RL 4 种端口模式（17952 pose），可能严重过度建模。\n8. **总实例分布**（本地）：326 强制实例（不是 266，我们任务描述里那个数已经过期）。其中 50 power pole + 46 boundary_storage_port + 10 storage box 是\"基础设施型\"，220 是制造类。\n\n## 二、可利用的游戏特性 → 模型具体简化映射\n\n### 高价值简化（每条都给出 candidate_placements 可量化的削减）\n\n1. **Storage Box 视为 0-port wireless sink，pose 数砍 75%**\n   - 现状：17952 pose（与 manufacturing_3x3 一样多，因为生成时套了 4 种端口模式）。\n   - 游戏事实：Protocol Stash 是无线 Depot 传送，玩家用法上\"end of production line, no belt needed\"。\n   - 改法：在 candidate generator 里把 protocol_storage_box 的 port_mode 退化成单一 `omni`，4 个 pose-mode → 1 个，**直接删掉 13464 个等价 pose**（≈ 4520 留下）。同时去掉它的 input/output_port_cells，binding subproblem 不再需要为它求 port 匹配。\n   - 工程量：1 处 generator 修改 + 删除 binding 端口约束分支 ≈ **0.5 ~ 1 人日**。\n\n2. **Manufacturing 6×4 端口规则锁定到 long_sides，砍掉 TB/BT 或 LR/RL 一半**\n   - 现状：本地 `port_rule: long_sides` 已写在 schema 里，但 candidate pool 里 6×4 的 4354 anchors × 平均 3.88 pose ≈ 16900 pose 还是把 4 个 mode 都展开了。Long sides 应该只保留长边方向的 2 mode（朝向旋转 90° 后又是另 2 mode，所以总共 4 种）——但是其中两种端口落在短边（4 格那侧），物理上违反 long_sides 规则。\n   - 改法：在 generator 加一行 `if template == 6x4 and port_mode in short_side_modes: skip`，**预计裁掉 50% = ~8400 pose**。\n   - 工程量：一行过滤 + 验证 binding 仍可行 ≈ **0.5 人日**。\n\n3. **boundary_storage_port 只生成 left+bottom 边界 anchor（已部分做到，但可再压）**\n   - 现状：134 pose 已经很少，确实只有 `left_base` 和 `bottom_base` 两个 mode，符合 `placement_rule: left_or_bottom_boundary`。\n   - 进一步简化：玩家蓝图共识是 boundary port 几乎只放在边界的中段（避免角落），可以加 `forbid corner ±2 格` 的几何启发（不是硬约束，作为 master 的 nogood/hint），**裁掉 ~20 pose**。这不影响 exactness（仍然枚举所有 134 但优先非角落）。\n   - 工程量：纯 hint，**0.5 人日**，且属于 AI sidecar 允许范围。\n\n### 中等价值简化\n\n4. **Core 9×9 只有 1 个，pose 数 7200 看起来过多**\n   - 现状：core 只有 2 mode（core_LR_out / core_TB_out），但 anchor 范围允许 9×9 在 70×70 内的所有 (62×62=3844) × 2 ≈ 7688，删掉重叠 ≈ 7200。\n   - 游戏事实：玩家蓝图共识 core 几乎总是放**网格中心或某条主轴中段**，因为 6 outputs 要喂 14 inputs，离边界太近会让所有产线都从一侧绕路。鹰角的 14 inputs/6 outputs 设计本身就强引导\"core 居中\"。\n   - 改法（仍保 exactness）：把 core 候选限制到内 50×50 区（anchor x,y ∈ [10, 50]），可证明：边界 5 格区域内的 core anchor 会让某些 mandatory 设施无端口可达——这需要 binding 子问题反推证明，但作为 **master 阶段的 ordering hint** 是安全的。\n   - 工程量：**1 人日**做 hint，**3-5 人日**做严格 exactness 证明（不推荐，性价比低）。\n\n5. **Power pole 覆盖半径 5 → 4761 pose 可结合\"覆盖+连通\"对偶简化**\n   - 现状：每个电杆 49 格覆盖、4761 candidate anchor、上限 50 个（exact 模式无硬上限）。\n   - 游戏事实：玩家共识\"电杆放在制造设施集中区中央，最多覆盖 7×7\"。这意味着电杆 candidate 集合可以限定在 \"至少覆盖 1 个 mandatory facility cell\" 的 anchor，能砍掉 1/3 ~ 1/2 的 pose。\n   - 改法：generator 增加预过滤 \"power_coverage_cells ∩ any_mandatory_anchor_window != ∅\"，**裁掉 ~1500-2000 pose**。\n   - 工程量：**1 人日**，需配 master/binding 回归测试。\n\n### 低价值/不建议\n\n6. **port_mode 4 种 → 2 种**：游戏内端口规则是 opposite_parallel_sides，已经隐含 \"TB 与 BT 等价（180° 旋转）\"。但是 `rotatable=true` 的设施，TB ≠ LR（两个不同朝向）。本地 4 种 mode 都需要保留，**不能砍**。\n\n7. **删除所有 storage box / boundary port 端口建模**：危险，因为虽然 Protocol Stash 是无线，但 commodity flow 仍要从某个 Stash 提取——flow 子问题需要\"汇点\"。当前用 input_port_cells 表达汇点是合理建模，**改成 omni 等于改 flow_subproblem 接口**，工程量大。\n\n## 三、关键链接\n\n- [终末地量化计算器 factory.ef.yituliu.cn](https://factory.ef.yituliu.cn/)（recipe ratio，不解决空间，但可校准我们的 production_targets）\n- [EnKAD 玩家蓝图编辑器](https://enkad.enka.network/)（社区蓝图来源）\n- [EndfieldTools.DEV 蓝图站](https://endfieldtools.dev/community-factories/)\n- [Mobalytics 基建总览](https://mobalytics.gg/arknights-endfield/bases)\n- [Endfield Talos Wiki - Protocol Stash](https://endfield.wiki.gg/wiki/Protocol_Stash)\n- [游民星空 1.2 更新一览](https://www.gamersky.com/handbook/202604/2125881.shtml)（武陵三期 8 新设施）\n- [GitHub: endfield-calc/factoriolab](https://github.com/endfield-calc/factoriolab)（本地 endfield_calc 快照来源 v0.5.2）\n\n## 四、最终推荐（3 条 + 工程量）\n\n| 优先级 | 简化项 | candidate pool 削减 | 工程量 | 风险 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| P1 | Protocol Storage Box pose 退化为单一 omni（无线 sink） | -13464 pose（占总池 ≈ 17%） | 0.5-1 人日 | 低，需要 binding/flow 测试回归一遍 |\n| P2 | manufacturing_6x4 严格执行 long_sides，砍掉短边端口 mode | -8000 pose 左右 | 0.5 人日 | 极低，纯几何过滤 |\n| P3 | power_pole 预过滤\"必须覆盖至少 1 个 mandatory anchor 窗口\" | -1500-2000 pose | 1 人日 | 需要证明覆盖图依然连通（用 flow 验证） |\n\nP1+P2 加起来能在不动 master CP-SAT 公式、不削弱 exactness 的前提下，把 candidate_placements 从 51 MB 砍到约 35-40 MB（≈ -25%），对应 binding 子问题的 pose 选择空间也同步缩小。**P3 必须先在小算例上跑 outer_search 回归，确认 frontier 没退化**，再上主线。\n\n**对 canonical_rules.json 的看法**：17 recipe + 7 facility template 是干净的最小覆盖，**没有冗余**，所有量都跟游戏内可观察值一致（电杆 5 格半径、core 6/14 端口、boundary 1×3）。建议保持原样，不要为了\"更简洁\"去合并 facility_template——`manufacturing_3x3` 和 `protocol_storage_box` 维度相同但 port_rule 不同，合并会破坏 exactness 边界。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":344,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1546,"cache_read_input_tokens":54208,"output_tokens":4361,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1546},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":344,"output_tokens":4361,"cache_read_input_tokens":54208,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1546,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1546,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CaotwwyM9FC2jnPGz4qtn","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"7651f244-6c7b-4a3a-a2ef-177021b9233f","timestamp":"2026-05-07T21:13:02.937Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
